# Vivado Generated Caches & Temporary Directories
.Xil/
**/.Xil/
**/*.cache/
**/*.runs/
**/*.gen/
**/*.sim/
**/*.hw/
**/*.ip_user_files/

# Xilinx Simulation Artifacts
**/xsim.dir/
**/*.wdb
**/*.pb
**/*.sdb
**/*.rlx
xvlog.log
xelab.log
xsim.log

# Vivado Journals & Logs
**/*.jou
**/*.backup.jou
**/*.log
**/*.backup.log
**/*.str

# Bitstreams and huge archives (board-specific; user must build their own)
**/*.bit
**/*.bin
**/*.mcs
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.7z
**/*.rar

# Timing & Debug Dumps (unless explicitly source controlled)
synth_warnings.txt
failed_path*.txt
failing_paths.txt
tight_setup_hold_pins.txt
dma_pins.txt
pin_dump.txt
all_pins_dump.txt
dfx_runtime.txt

# Temp / Local scratchpad folders
Temp/
Unsorted/
Logs/
Deploy/
Build/
Exports/
test_impl/
test_sim/
sim_test/
riscv-toolchain/
Cadence/

# JVM / OS Crash Logs
hs_err_pid*.log

# Python Bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / Editor Artifacts
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
